  "details": "Title says it. In a public instance of a world, it appears that LocalPlayer.isInstanceOwner is showing as false on the user who uploaded.\nAccording to multiple staff (notably PhaseDragon confirming this expectation multiple times in discord), the VRCPlayerAPI.isInstanceOwner _should_ be true for the world uploader for any public instance.\n\nHere is a recording showing the behaviour: https://streamable.com/mgfgso\nMy authoring account should be able to see the lock icon when LocalPlayer.isInstanceOwner is true, but it never is set to true.",
